      "name": "Perfect Repair",
      "slug": "perfect-repair",
      "teaser": "Repair armor and weapons with no penalty or wear. Can be restricted to kits.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2120.png",
      "downloads": 14626,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Remove weapon and armor degradation after repairs.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>What it says it does</li>\n<li>Can restrict this function to only when you use a repair kit</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract mattdokn-perfectrepair.zip into your game folder</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7658-vkrw58b-1-gif/\" alt=\"7658-vkrw58b-1-gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>The config has comments in it to explain.</p>\n<p>You can disable weapon or armor functionality if you’d like.</p>\n<p>As well as only having this mod work when using a repair kit.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you see anything that stands out to you, please let me know in the comments and I’ll work on it as soon as I can!</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
